From: COSMOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Show live status on filament-loading prompts

Keep nozzle/target temperatures, filament-switch state and step time visible
while COSMOS loading prompts are open. Refresh a small local status snapshot
from Moonraker deltas under the LVGL lock, and update the elapsed time once
per second without rebuilding the prompt or its buttons. Close interrupted
loading prompts when Klipper or Moonraker disconnects to discard stale data.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [COSMOS-specific filament-loading prompts]

